SUMMARY:Swiss AI SME Circle #5
LOCATION:SUPSI Campus Est\, Via la Santa 1\, Lugano
DESCRIPTION:Updates from the Swiss AI Initiative and the Apertus engineerin
 g team\, talks by LLM practitioners\, live demos and four interactive brea
 kout sessions for SMEs putting AI to work\, starting with a networking lun
 ch.\n\nOrganiser: Swiss AI Initiative (ETH Zurich\, EPFL and CSCS) with SU
 PSI\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/swiss-a
 i-sme-circle-5-lugano-2026/
