SUMMARY:AI Salon | Guardie e ladri — Hacker: come attaccano\, come difend
 erci
LOCATION:Acer Europe\, Via della Posta 28\, Bioggio (Lugano)
DESCRIPTION:An Italian- and English-language evening in Ticino on how recen
 t\, well-known cyberattacks actually worked and how generative AI is shift
 ing the balance between attackers and defenders\, with a social-engineerin
 g quiz and a networking aperitif.\n\nOrganiser: AI Salon Ticino\, hosted b
 y Acer Europe\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/even
 ts/ai-salon-guardie-e-ladri-bioggio-2026/
